  "question": "What are the main trends shown in the global app market?",
  "status": "complete",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-21T16:19:56.438666Z",
  "completedAt": "2026-09-21T16:20:20.516981Z",
  "answers": {
    "vision": {
      "answer": "The 2018 global app market totaled about $146 billion, led by iOS with 63% of revenue and especially strong dominance in the Americas. Asia Pacific was the largest regional market and had a more balanced platform mix, including substantial third-party Android revenue. Overall market growth was projected near 14% annually through 2022, with third-party Android growing fastest at roughly 18%.",
